{"content":{"blocks":[{"content":"1\t# Text-Attributed Graph Sequence to Text-Attributed Graph Sequence (TAGSeq2TAGSeq)\n2\t\n3\tThis experiment explores training language models on graph-structured data. It implements custom data loading pipelines that traverse the text-attributed document graph to construct packed sequences.\n4\t\n5\t## Usage\n6\t\n7\t### Inspecting Data\n8\t\n9\tTo see how the graph traversal works and what the packed batches look like:\n10\t\n11\t```bash\n12\tpython experiments/dagseq2dagseq/demo_traversal.py /path/to/pretokenized/dataset --strategy random_walk\n13\t```\n14\t\n15\t### Training\n16\t\n17\tTo run the training script:\n18\t\n19\t```bash\n20\t# Using default config\n21\tpython experiments/dagseq2dagseq/main.py --dataset-dir data/pretokenized_datasets/simplewiki_full\n22\t\n23\t# With custom settings\n24\tpython experiments/dagseq2dagseq/main.py \\\n25\t  --dataset-dir data/pretokenized_datasets/simplewiki_full \\\n26\t  --strategy random_walk \\\n27\t  --max-seq-len 4096 \\\n28\t  --seed 42\n29\t```\n30\t","tool_use_id":"toolu_014wpQHw4SdaEHuv4oeKhMAK","type":"tool_result"}],"role":"user"},"context":{"branch":"main","cwd":"/Users/evintunador/repos/evintunador/turnbridge","head":"49da723e6046dbccfcf0e3966f6e68a44a5964dd","repo":"git@github.com:evintunador/turnbridge.git"},"id":"ev2-a4971cc392aac0a1fb991af94677105946696090785c3b9040fe44949ef71627","kind":"conversation_turn","meta":{"actor":{"type":"human"},"session_id":"c158a677-efd7-4ff4-87ac-1c3052566c2e","source":"claude-code"},"occurred_at":"2026-07-19T17:14:06.546Z","producer":{"tool":"cledger","version":"0.2.0"},"raw":{"data":{"cwd":"/Users/evintunador/repos/evintunador/turnbridge","entrypoint":"cli","gitBranch":"main","isSidechain":false,"message":{"content":[{"content":"1\t# Text-Attributed Graph Sequence to Text-Attributed Graph Sequence (TAGSeq2TAGSeq)\n2\t\n3\tThis experiment explores training language models on graph-structured data. It implements custom data loading pipelines that traverse the text-attributed document graph to construct packed sequences.\n4\t\n5\t## Usage\n6\t\n7\t### Inspecting Data\n8\t\n9\tTo see how the graph traversal works and what the packed batches look like:\n10\t\n11\t```bash\n12\tpython experiments/dagseq2dagseq/demo_traversal.py /path/to/pretokenized/dataset --strategy random_walk\n13\t```\n14\t\n15\t### Training\n16\t\n17\tTo run the training script:\n18\t\n19\t```bash\n20\t# Using default config\n21\tpython experiments/dagseq2dagseq/main.py --dataset-dir data/pretokenized_datasets/simplewiki_full\n22\t\n23\t# With custom settings\n24\tpython experiments/dagseq2dagseq/main.py \\\n25\t  --dataset-dir data/pretokenized_datasets/simplewiki_full \\\n26\t  --strategy random_walk \\\n27\t  --max-seq-len 4096 \\\n28\t  --seed 42\n29\t```\n30\t","tool_use_id":"toolu_014wpQHw4SdaEHuv4oeKhMAK","type":"tool_result"}],"role":"user"},"parentUuid":"41b3d08c-1b6d-4a75-8c46-39e680d4c203","promptId":"5802adfd-dd29-4252-b8b0-ed28762a2d6d","sessionId":"c158a677-efd7-4ff4-87ac-1c3052566c2e","session_id":"c158a677-efd7-4ff4-87ac-1c3052566c2e","slug":"generic-stirring-candy","sourceToolAssistantUUID":"41b3d08c-1b6d-4a75-8c46-39e680d4c203","timestamp":"2026-07-19T17:14:06.546Z","toolUseResult":{"file":{"content":"# Text-Attributed Graph Sequence to Text-Attributed Graph Sequence (TAGSeq2TAGSeq)\n\nThis experiment explores training language models on graph-structured data. It implements custom data loading pipelines that traverse the text-attributed document graph to construct packed sequences.\n\n## Usage\n\n### Inspecting Data\n\nTo see how the graph traversal works and what the packed batches look like:\n\n```bash\npython experiments/dagseq2dagseq/demo_traversal.py /path/to/pretokenized/dataset --strategy random_walk\n```\n\n### Training\n\nTo run the training script:\n\n```bash\n# Using default config\npython experiments/dagseq2dagseq/main.py --dataset-dir data/pretokenized_datasets/simplewiki_full\n\n# With custom settings\npython experiments/dagseq2dagseq/main.py \\\n  --dataset-dir data/pretokenized_datasets/simplewiki_full \\\n  --strategy random_walk \\\n  --max-seq-len 4096 \\\n  --seed 42\n```\n","filePath":"/Users/evintunador/repos/evintunador/tagseq2tagseq/README.md","numLines":30,"startLine":1,"totalLines":30},"type":"text"},"type":"user","userType":"external","uuid":"3a1de549-de9c-49ca-acb1-6d3a957b0623","version":"2.1.215"},"format":"claude-code-jsonl/1"},"recorded_at":"2026-07-19T17:18:00.107Z","schema":"annals/v1","stream":{"id":"claude-code:c158a677-efd7-4ff4-87ac-1c3052566c2e","seq":806}}
